.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2a/Entama_GUTSwhite.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181126103603","caption":"Entama GUTSwhite.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/2a/Entama_GUTSwhite.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181126103603"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Entama_CafeBrown.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/92/Entama_CafeBrown.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181126103941","caption":"Entama CafeBrown.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/9/92/Entama_CafeBrown.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181126103941"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Entama_ChocolateSilver.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/19/Entama_ChocolateSilver.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181126103949","caption":"Entama ChocolateSilver.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/1/19/Entama_ChocolateSilver.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181126103949"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Entama_AllBlue.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/df/Entama_AllBlue.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181126103959","caption":"Entama AllBlue.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/d/df/Entama_AllBlue.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181126103959"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Entama_AllPink.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/29/Entama_AllPink.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/320?cb=20181126104005","caption":"Entama AllPink.jpg","large":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/29/Entama_AllPink.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181126104005"},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Entama_YellowSweater.jpg","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a1/Entama_YellowSweater.jpg/revision/latest/scal